      "anchor": "[c-hex:REQ-001]",
      "body": "The existing application shall provide a browser-based page where a user can enter a value and\nrequest hexadecimal conversion. *(S1, S2; DOC-002 Q-004)*",
      "bodySha256": "cde7435f902fe79494a5c32614ef33b696238e135a86defc0937b98ee090c8d2",
